      "clientWidth": 1440,
      "bodyText": "Skip to main content\nAgent CLI Contract\nDemo\nInstall\nPrivacy\nDemo — sample data, nothing is saved\nReset demo\nStart for real\n\nISOLATED FIELD TEST\n\nReview a complete CLI contract run\n\nThis sample uses the same four fixtures bundled with the Rust binary.\n\nRun sample contract\nShow a blocked change\nagent-contract.yml\nSample fixture\nversion: 1\ncommand: [\"ridge-cli\"]\nfixtures:\n  - name: inspect stable record\n    modes: [text, tty, json]\n    expect:\n      exit: 0\n    idempotent: true\n    allow_network: false\nREPORT / DEMO-001\nAll four contract checks pass\nPASS · 4\nFIXTURE\nMODE\nEXIT\nRESULT\ninspect stable record\ntext\n0\nPass\ninspect stable record\ntty\n0\nPass\ninspect stable record\njson\n0\nPass\ninvalid input stays recoverable\njson\n4\nPass\n\nSELF-HOSTED TERMINAL RECORDING\n\nWatch the same sample run in the CLI\ncontract survey · local\n$ agent-contract check agent-contract.yml\n✓ inspect stable record [text]\n✓ inspect stable record [tty]\n✓ inspect stable record [json]\n✓ invalid input stays recoverable [json]\nPASS 4 checks · report.md + report.json\n\nRun agent-contract demo to create this report in a temporary directory.\n\nTest CLI contracts before agents depend on them.\n\nPrivacy\nTerms\n\nBuilt by Param Factory · v0.1.0",
